      "source_format": ".md",
      "content_markdown": "#\n\nThe Marsden Valley Trapping Group runs community trapping activity in Marsden Valley New Zealand and uses this dashboard to publish public trapping trends from Trap.NZ data.\nFollow the group on [the Marsden Valley Trapping Group Facebook page](https://www.facebook.com/groups/991610803052734/).\n\nThis site focuses on simple views of catch history:\n\n- weekly catches for the selected species and period\n- same-species comparison across available years\n- summary totals and trend indicators for rolling periods and calendar years\n\nThe current dashboard is intended as a public summary view rather than a full operational analysis tool."
    }
